description: ConsumeView security — API keys and localhost binding
globs:
  - "**/*"
alwaysApply: true
---

# Security rules

- Never send real Gemini / xAI API keys to Cursor, chat logs, or remote services.
- Store secrets only via the OS keyring (`src-tauri/src/secrets/`) or the local `0600` fallback file in the app data directory.
- The Axum proxy must bind to `127.0.0.1` only — never `0.0.0.0`.
- Frontend may show key *status* (set / missing), never echo stored secret values back into the UI.
